repository-code: "https://github.com/NikoriakViktot/floodstate-eo"
abstract: "Context-Aware Multisensor Earth Observation for Flood-State Reconstruction. v0.2.0-alpha: canonical EO preprocessing and temporal composites; Kakhovka 2023 case study with a physical daily-inundation reconstruction (SWOT + gauge water surface on terrain, Monte-Carlo uncertainty), cross-sensor and ICESat-2 checks, an RF20 surface-context product and U-Net weak-label experiments. Numbers are agreement with weak reference labels; a canonical multi-class flood-state product does not exist yet. Submission snapshot for Paper 3 of the Kakhovka series; a versioned release DOI is minted on Zenodo from the GitHub release."
